mdns-bridge is a multicast DNS (mDNS) bridge daemon. It forwards mDNS
traffic (Bonjour/zeroconf: AirPlay, AirPrint, Chromecast, HomeKit/Matter
and similar) between network segments, supporting both IPv4 and IPv6 as
well as filtering of the mDNS services allowed to cross segments.

This plugin replaces the deprecated os-mdns-repeater plugin, which
wrapped an abandoned daemon that only supported IPv4.

WWW: https://github.com/dennypage/mdns-bridge

